[00:00.00] 作词 : 子键
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 子键
[00:15.00]
[04:00.82][01:37.76][00:20.12]Thin boy thinks that I should be fat
[04:05.11][01:41.97][00:24.37]While fat girl is boring there are too many fat
[04:09.37][01:46.34][00:28.65]Single girl is afraid of night
[04:13.69][01:50.66][00:32.97]She thinks the devil will come tonight
[04:18.08][01:55.22][00:37.42]There is nothing I can take pride in
[04:22.59][01:59.65][00:42.12]Because I have lost the prime of my life
[04:26.58][02:03.82][00:46.22]Thin boy thinks that I should not be sad
[04:30.85][02:08.19][00:50.60]I will try my best to win the rest of my life
[00:55.88]
[04:36.06][02:13.71][01:02.72]I do it but you think a fat boy
[04:43.04][02:20.65][01:09.66]can be fit more than I can
[02:31.11][01:21.05]
[03:43.84]There is something wrong with my head
[03:47.86]It cause I am different with anybody
[03:51.98]When I try to think about you in my head
[03:56.31]The memory is so sick that I should come back
[04:54.27]
